  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p><strong>Prerequisites:</strong> Casting class feature; any talent with the strike descriptor.</p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> When activating a magic sphere talent with the strike descriptor, you may spend a spell point to instead use the sphere effect in conjunction with making a full attack. The magic sphere effect is delivered through the first successful attack made as part of that full attack routine; if no attack is successful, no creature is targeted with the magic sphere effect and any spell points spent are wasted.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/mageknight#toc83\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
      "instructions": ""
    },
